WEBVTT

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:08.220
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:14.730
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.560
It's my day!

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:27.140
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:34.550
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:41.920
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:49.330
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:55.100
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:02.240
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:09.750
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:15.890
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:18.950
I just want to walk

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:22.490
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:26.460
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.430 --> 00:01:35.370
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:41.810
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:44.080
It's my day!

00:02:00.460 --> 00:02:02.900
<i>I have something
I want to protect, too.</i>

00:02:13.710 --> 00:02:16.180
W-what are you doing,
stalking me?

00:02:16.980 --> 00:02:20.810
You oughta know we've been
practicing really hard.

00:02:21.650 --> 00:02:23.920
You're not getting
an easy win tomorrow.

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:29.220
I'm good at lay-ups.

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:32.430
Kazuya's dribbling
needs more work, though.

00:02:33.260 --> 00:02:35.800
But there's an outside chance
we'll win.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:49.550
"Two Ways to Love"

00:02:52.280 --> 00:02:56.820
If you'd just say you love me,
I'll cancel tomorrow's showdown.

00:02:58.350 --> 00:02:59.250
Domyoji...

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:01.420
<i>What?</i>

00:03:05.860 --> 00:03:07.030
<i>What's happening?</i>

00:03:13.900 --> 00:03:16.740
<i>Why am I in his arms?</i>

00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:26.440
<i>My head's spinning and
my strength is draining out of me.</i>

00:03:34.220 --> 00:03:34.860
Say it!

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:39.990
Three little words...

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:47.530
That you love me...

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:57.280
Say it.

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:00.840
Makino.

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:03.990
You're hurting me. Let me go.

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:09.390
How big a fool do you need
to make out of me?

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:14.160
No!

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:16.960
Stop it!

00:04:23.370 --> 00:04:24.300
No!

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:06.880
You hate me that much?

00:05:14.050 --> 00:05:14.620
<i>No...</i>

00:05:18.190 --> 00:05:18.990
<i>That's not it.</i>

00:05:25.390 --> 00:05:27.260
You look like you'd rather
kill yourself.

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:29.800
Do you love Rui that much?

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:36.600
<i>If I let him kiss me...
I don't think I could forgive myself.</i>

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:47.110
Why Rui? Why my best friend?

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:15.020
This is ridiculous.
Why'd I fall for a girl like you?

00:06:18.780 --> 00:06:22.460
<i>I'm sorry, I'm sorry, Domyoji...
I'm sorry.</i>

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:29.860
The great Tsukasa Domyoji
declared his love for a nobody like you...

00:06:32.670 --> 00:06:33.360
Ouch!

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:37.760
You're really... such a fool.

00:06:46.440 --> 00:06:48.620
Don't come crying to me later.

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:56.250
I'm not pulling any punches
tomorrow. Be ready.

00:06:58.920 --> 00:07:00.180
That's fine with me!

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:03.850
You've got spirit.

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:18.200
Just what I expect
from Tsukushi Makino!

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:21.970
Idiot!

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:35.520
<i>Maybe someday,
I'll deeply regret this night...</i>

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:39.890
<i>But I've got no choice.</i>

00:07:44.490 --> 00:07:45.410
<i>I...</i>

00:07:49.930 --> 00:07:52.100
<i>I have something
I want to protect, too.</i>

00:07:55.140 --> 00:08:00.190
<i>I've decided to believe in
Rui Hanazawa's clear, marble-like eyes.</i>

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:20.630
Today's lucky charm...

00:08:25.820 --> 00:08:27.820
Something Yellow

00:08:28.300 --> 00:08:29.400
Something yellow?

00:08:35.180 --> 00:08:36.380
I don't have anything yellow...

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:46.150
<i>That's right...
Rui Hanazawa bought this for me.</i>

00:08:47.350 --> 00:08:49.420
<i>It's the best good-luck charm ever...</i>

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:08.610
<i>I'm ready to go!
Nothing else matters today.</i>

00:09:13.810 --> 00:09:15.180
Look at all those people!

00:09:17.150 --> 00:09:17.650
Yo...

00:09:19.850 --> 00:09:21.250
Sleep well last night?

00:09:22.150 --> 00:09:26.180
Yeah... Though I'm a little sore
from practice yesterday.

00:09:28.490 --> 00:09:29.130
I see.

00:09:35.770 --> 00:09:40.040
<i>He's humming...
like it's any other day.</i>

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:42.440
<i>He's got nerves of steel.</i>

00:09:51.420 --> 00:09:52.220
<i>I...</i>

00:09:55.290 --> 00:09:57.020
<i>I'm going to stand by this guy...</i>

00:10:01.390 --> 00:10:03.430
<i>I decided that last night.</i>

00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:05.880
Tsukushi!

00:10:07.730 --> 00:10:10.820
Kazuya...
What's with all those bruises?

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:14.440
I got up at five this morning
and practiced at the park.

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:17.640
I couldn't sleep in
on such a big day.

00:10:18.210 --> 00:10:20.740
I can't let you get expelled.

00:10:22.650 --> 00:10:23.750
...Kazuya...

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:28.550
You've got heart.

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:34.360
Let's go.

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:49.430
<i>At this moment...</i>

00:10:50.270 --> 00:10:53.440
<i>Domyoji's smile from last night
flashed through my mind.</i>

00:10:55.810 --> 00:11:01.280
<i>I hadn't noticed the determination
hidden behind that smile.</i>

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:28.240
The game will last 10 minutes.
The team with more points wins.

00:11:29.510 --> 00:11:32.880
The losers will accept
the demands of the winners.

00:11:34.680 --> 00:11:35.820
No hard feelings.

00:11:38.790 --> 00:11:41.520
Go! Go! F3! Fight!

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:46.180
<i>It's Sakurako, Asai, and her gang.</i>

00:11:46.690 --> 00:11:49.430
Fight! Fight! F3!

00:11:50.460 --> 00:11:53.400
<i>I can't lose.
My pride's on the line.</i>

00:11:54.200 --> 00:11:59.170
<i>If I'm expelled,
all my fighting to stay in school...</i>

00:11:59.170 --> 00:12:00.470
<i>will have been for nothing.</i>

00:12:17.220 --> 00:12:18.380
<i>I can't let him get to me.</i>

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:24.860
<i>He's the enemy!</i>

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:34.270
Tsukasa's team will start on
offense. Start the match!

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:36.180
Go!

00:12:44.620 --> 00:12:45.250
<i>He's tall!</i>

00:12:59.660 --> 00:13:01.230
Tsukasa's team scores one point.

00:13:04.340 --> 00:13:04.960
Makino!

00:13:04.960 --> 00:13:05.500
Got it!

00:13:08.070 --> 00:13:08.530
Tsukasa!

00:13:08.940 --> 00:13:09.230
Yo!

00:13:42.010 --> 00:13:44.310
<i>They're faster and better...</i>

00:13:44.780 --> 00:13:46.940
<i>What'll we do?
At this rate, we'll lose!</i>

00:13:48.150 --> 00:13:49.110
Seven minutes down...

00:13:49.950 --> 00:13:50.980
<i>Not enough time!</i>

00:13:58.590 --> 00:13:59.590
We win.

00:14:00.420 --> 00:14:02.130
We've still got three minutes left.

00:14:02.590 --> 00:14:05.660
Yeah, right... What can you do
in three minutes?

00:14:06.060 --> 00:14:09.500
Don't be stubborn.
Admit you've lost.

00:14:09.830 --> 00:14:13.570
I'll do anything to protect Makino.

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:15.040
Is that so!

00:14:32.590 --> 00:14:36.990
Rui Hanazawa! That was great!
You did it!

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:43.400
Don't just stand there! Sojiro! Akira!

00:14:43.870 --> 00:14:47.040
Huh? What are you getting
so mad about?

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:49.770
Rui can't do anything alone.

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:52.040
Shut up! Don't talk back to me!

00:14:52.370 --> 00:14:54.970
Ouch! What do you think
you're doing?!

00:14:55.940 --> 00:14:58.250
Tsukasa, you don't have to hit him
just because you're mad.

00:14:59.010 --> 00:15:01.480
Shut up! Do you want one, too?

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:04.290
What are they doing?

00:15:05.350 --> 00:15:06.020
Makino...

00:15:07.790 --> 00:15:09.220
Will you do
whatever it takes to win?

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:12.990
That's my plan.

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:28.510
He's kissing her! At a time like this!

00:15:29.180 --> 00:15:30.180
I can't believe it!

00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:31.810
No! Hanazawa!

00:15:36.420 --> 00:15:37.470
Rui Hanazawa!

00:15:37.470 --> 00:15:40.020
How could you do that here!
What are you thinking?

00:15:40.350 --> 00:15:41.620
Shh... Laugh.

00:15:42.260 --> 00:15:42.690
Huh?

00:15:43.260 --> 00:15:44.320
Just laugh.

00:15:45.020 --> 00:15:46.090
Laugh?

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:51.690
What a face!

00:15:51.690 --> 00:15:53.970
What do you mean?!
You told me to...

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:57.170
What's with those two?

00:15:59.910 --> 00:16:01.270
Let's go, Tsukushi.

00:16:01.610 --> 00:16:03.240
What? Tsukushi?

00:16:09.210 --> 00:16:09.720
Foul!

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:11.950
What's he doing?

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:14.520
Rui Hanazawa, free throw.

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:20.790
Two points for Rui's team.

00:16:24.430 --> 00:16:24.960
Tsukasa!

00:16:25.300 --> 00:16:25.760
Yo!

00:16:32.870 --> 00:16:33.840
Offensive foul!

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:36.440
Rui Hanazawa, free throw.

00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:41.580
You've got to do it,
Rui Hanazawa!

00:16:45.220 --> 00:16:45.780
No...

00:16:46.850 --> 00:16:48.420
Is that his plan?

00:16:50.220 --> 00:16:51.760
This is no time
for jealousy, Tsukasa!

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:55.810
You can say I'm playing dirty,
if you like.

00:16:55.810 --> 00:16:57.330
I can't lose.

00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:02.030
It's my fault that
Makino's involved in this.

00:17:04.230 --> 00:17:06.100
Two more points and
we'll be tied!

00:17:06.570 --> 00:17:08.170
Calm down, Tsukasa.

00:17:08.510 --> 00:17:09.240
Shut up!

00:17:10.740 --> 00:17:11.940
30 seconds remaining...

00:17:13.210 --> 00:17:14.140
<i>30 seconds?</i>

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:16.280
What can we do?

00:17:16.810 --> 00:17:18.350
We've got to get
a two-point basket.

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:20.600
I'll steal the ball from them.

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:24.450
You throw the ball at the basket
as hard as you can from here.

00:17:25.820 --> 00:17:28.220
W-what if it doesn't go in?

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:32.360
I'll stop time for you.

00:17:38.600 --> 00:17:39.540
<i>Rui Hanazawa...</i>

00:17:40.370 --> 00:17:41.770
<i>It was because you were here,</i>

00:17:42.070 --> 00:17:44.510
<i>that I was able to stay
at this school.</i>

00:17:48.910 --> 00:17:49.540
Makino!

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:55.720
<i>Even when I got the red slip,
and had garbage thrown at me...</i>

00:17:56.250 --> 00:17:57.620
<i>and was ignored by everyone...</i>

00:17:59.620 --> 00:18:02.060
<i>Those words have
erased them all.</i>

00:18:03.490 --> 00:18:06.730
<i>Please... go in! Go in!</i>

00:18:09.030 --> 00:18:11.340
<i>If it doesn't go in,
it'll be the end of everything.</i>

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:18.710
<i>I was always all alone.</i>

00:18:19.940 --> 00:18:22.310
<i>Every morning,
my bag was so heavy...</i>

00:18:23.310 --> 00:18:25.910
<i>But I knew one day
I'd cast off that weight.</i>

00:18:26.280 --> 00:18:30.850
<i>I believed that day would come.
Graduation Day.</i>

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:38.160
<i>Then, I would've beaten this school.
That's what I believed.</i>

00:18:45.730 --> 00:18:50.470
<i>That's why I can't be expelled...
Please, please go in!</i>

00:18:59.780 --> 00:19:00.750
<i>It didn't...</i>

00:19:02.550 --> 00:19:03.820
Expelled...

00:19:04.320 --> 00:19:05.350
Expelled...

00:19:05.850 --> 00:19:06.950
Expelled...

00:19:07.490 --> 00:19:08.490
Expelled...

00:19:08.920 --> 00:19:09.960
Expelled...

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:11.460
Expelled...

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:13.130
Expelled...

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:14.490
Expelled...

00:19:14.860 --> 00:19:15.740
Expelled...

00:19:15.740 --> 00:19:16.930
Go, Kazuya!

00:19:17.730 --> 00:19:19.130
Yes, sir!

00:19:20.970 --> 00:19:22.330
Huh? When did he...?

00:19:23.770 --> 00:19:24.610
10 seconds left.

00:19:25.670 --> 00:19:27.910
Tsukushi! One more point!

00:19:30.040 --> 00:19:30.680
Ohh...

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:32.580
Tsukasa's team has the ball.

00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:38.420
Tsukasa!

00:19:40.720 --> 00:19:41.690
Tsukasa!

00:19:47.020 --> 00:19:47.710
I quit!

00:19:47.710 --> 00:19:48.660
Huh?

00:19:49.890 --> 00:19:53.360
It's a childish game. It's so stupid.

00:19:54.100 --> 00:19:56.040
What are you saying?

00:19:57.770 --> 00:19:58.770
It's ridiculous.

00:20:00.370 --> 00:20:04.810
Why do I have to get all sweaty
over a game like this? I quit.

00:20:05.310 --> 00:20:06.910
You quit?

00:20:07.650 --> 00:20:09.380
You're the one who started this!

00:20:10.550 --> 00:20:12.680
<i>Hurray! We're tied!</i>

00:20:13.320 --> 00:20:13.960
Hey!

00:20:14.790 --> 00:20:15.720
<i>Domyoji?</i>

00:20:18.490 --> 00:20:19.920
Domyoji!

00:20:32.570 --> 00:20:35.200
It's over... Do what you like.

00:20:42.980 --> 00:20:45.780
Does this mean the game's called off?

00:20:46.350 --> 00:20:49.420
It would have been over
in 10 seconds! Why?

00:20:57.990 --> 00:21:01.160
He's always been like that...

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:02.400
Yeah...

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:07.080
We'd all be playing a game and
he'd say, "I quit," out of the blue.

00:21:07.540 --> 00:21:11.760
He's always been so self-centered.

00:21:11.760 --> 00:21:12.840
Yeah.

00:21:14.310 --> 00:21:17.550
<i>It's over... Do what you like.</i>

00:21:29.720 --> 00:21:33.530
<i>If you hadn't said that,
I'd have been expelled...</i>

00:21:49.180 --> 00:21:50.140
<i>Domyoji...</i>

00:22:05.390 --> 00:22:11.460
You let your hair down a little

00:22:13.430 --> 00:22:19.340
You hid the fact
that you were crying

00:22:21.110 --> 00:22:29.210
I noticed, but I
couldn't ask you why

00:22:29.450 --> 00:22:37.260
I can never be
honest about how I feel

00:22:37.260 --> 00:22:45.030
Until after we've split
up after a bad fight

00:22:45.300 --> 00:22:53.170
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:22:45.300 --> 00:22:53.170
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:22:53.170 --> 00:23:01.550
I can say "I love you"...

00:22:53.170 --> 00:23:01.550
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:03.350 --> 00:23:11.320
Do you really hate me this time?

00:23:11.320 --> 00:23:19.100
Will you end up running to him?

00:23:19.360 --> 00:23:27.270
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:23:19.360 --> 00:23:27.270
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:27.270 --> 00:23:35.680
I can say "I love you"...

00:23:27.270 --> 00:23:35.680
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:49.390 --> 00:23:53.430
Domyoji walks the streets at night
trying to find an answer.

00:23:53.900 --> 00:23:58.130
Rui still longs for Shizuka,
which changes our relationship

00:23:58.630 --> 00:24:01.140
and sparks a change within me.

00:24:02.040 --> 00:24:04.840
Hana Yori Dango: "Sleepless Night!"

00:24:05.370 --> 00:24:08.780
Thank you Rui Hanazawa,
for telling me the truth.
